"hook": "The first approved CAR-T therapy uses a disarmed HIV-derived virus 🧬",
"fact": "Tisagenlecleucel reprograms a patient's own T cells using a lentiviral vector derived from HIV that cannot cause infection. In 2012, Emily Whitehead became the first child treated with this CAR-T approach, and the FDA approved it in 2017.",
