"hook": "This burn treatment comes from pineapple stems 🍍",
"fact": "NexoBrid (anacaulase-bcdb) is a gel of protein-digesting enzymes enriched in bromelain, taken from pineapple stems. Spread on a deep burn for 4 hours, it dissolves the dead tissue (eschar) so the living layer underneath can be seen, instead of cutting it away in surgery. The FDA approved it for adults in 2022 and for children in 2024.",
"es_hook": "Este tratamiento para quemaduras viene de los tallos de la piña 🍍",
