"fact": "Ryoncil is made of mesenchymal stromal cells grown from the bone marrow of healthy adult donors and given by IV infusion. In 2024 the FDA approved it as the first mesenchymal stromal cell therapy, for steroid-refractory acute graft-versus-host disease in children 2 months and older. In its main study, 70% of children had a complete or partial response at day 28.",
