"fact": "Omisirge (omidubicel-onlv), approved by the FDA in April 2023, is made by culturing part of a donated umbilical cord blood unit with nicotinamide, a form of vitamin B3, which helps the blood-forming cells multiply while keeping their stem cell properties. In its pivotal trial, median neutrophil recovery after transplant was 12 days compared with 22 days for standard cord blood.",
